to add 20, 25 grams of protein every time you have a shake. That's adding protein. That's good. Yes,

00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:43,180
you could use that. We also have a product called Protein Zine through it's a product made from U.S.

00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:51,020
